## analysis
- Amethyst release IPA bundles LWJGL 3.3.3 (libs/lwjgl.jar); MC 26.2 requires LWJGL 3.4.1 (spvc classes/natives).
- Source repo supports 3.4.1, but the release binary predates that logic (no lwjgl_versions.txt in app).
- Fix path: obtain/build current Amethyst (source has Natives/resources/Frameworks/lwjgl34 + JavaApp/libs/lwjgl-3.4.1) or inject 3.4.1 support.
